<figure class="guide-figure" aria-label="How your next training week reaches the calendar">
<ol class="guide-flow">
<li><strong>Record</strong><span>Save what you actually completed and how it felt.</span></li>
<li><strong>Check in</strong><span>Send method feedback during the window shown.</span></li>
<li><strong>Prepare</strong><span>LSU prepares the next seven-day draft.</span></li>
<li><strong>Review</strong><span>A coach checks, adjusts and approves the week.</span></li>
<li><strong>Train</strong><span>Approved sessions appear on your calendar.</span></li>
</ol>
<figcaption>Feedback starts preparation. Coach approval releases training. <a href="/diagrams/weekly-training/index.html">Explore the full workflow</a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
